Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz16.02\pos(1011.668,289.804)}天音莉莉!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz17.34\pos(972.765,502.6)}作响的Lyric
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\pos(1052.861,603.279)\frz18.23}这个Loud SOUL哟!
